.TH VIGIL-CONFIGURATOR 1 2018-12-07 Vigil
.SH NAME
vigil-configurator \- Vigil Configurator
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvigil-configurator\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION

\fBVIGIL-CONFIGURATOR\fR is a configuration tool which allows the site
admin to configure and customize all components of a local Vigil
installation through a graphical user interface. The program is started
by the administrator with elevated privileges whenever necessary.

.PP
For more information about the vigil-configurator, point your browser to file:///usr/share/doc/packages/vigil-configurator or https://vigil.io/.
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR vigil-service (1), vigil-master (1)

.PP
.IR https://vigil.io/

.SH AUTHOR
Vigil has been written by Tobias Junghans.
.PP
